This test computes the 1D PDR structure for the parameters corresponding to the benchmark tests presented in Rollig et al. 2007, using the GOW network (Gong, Ostriker & Wolfire 2017; Hunter et al. 2023).
The default test (test_pdr.f90 as checked in) is the V1 test in Rollig et al. 2007. You can modify chi0 and ntot to do a different one, or use run_Rollig_suite.py to run all four (V1-V4) automatically.
The setup_Rollig_test.py will automatically change the H2 formation rate on grains to one identical to the test. This is done automatically when running make.
Result files for the PDR codes in the project are available here: https://lecture.ph1.uni-koeln.de/pdr-comparison/results_data_post.htm (a copy is kept in ../tests/popsicle_semenov_photo_cr_full_RolligPDRBenchmark/RolligPDROutputs/, shared with the full-network benchmark since it is the same published reference data).